@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

title Registrar Daily Workflow

actor Registrar
participant "Applicant Queue" as AQ
participant "Student Management" as SM
participant "Block Overview" as BO
participant "Grade Submissions" as GS
participant "COR Generation" as COR

Registrar -> AQ : Review new applicants
AQ --> Registrar : Show submitted applications
Registrar -> AQ : Approve / Reject / Mark incomplete
Registrar -> SM : View enrolled students
SM --> Registrar : Show student records & history

Registrar -> BO : Check block sections
BO --> Registrar : Show blocks & enrollment counts
Registrar -> BO : Assign subjects to blocks

Registrar -> GS : Review submitted grades
GS --> Registrar : Show per-professor submissions
Registrar -> GS : Verify / Return / Publish

Registrar -> COR : Generate Certificate of Registration
COR --> Registrar : PDF for enrolled students

@enduml
